nt":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":736920101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":1374381362,"text":"Ah, hello there, Traveler. It would seem that you're here to take part in the Wisdom Gala.","nextNodeIds":[736920102]},{"nodeId":736920102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":1659014906,"text":"If it would interest you, would you like to try out the game that we at Amurta have set up?","nextNodeIds":[736920103]},{"nodeId":736920103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4138924858,"text":"And what sort of game would that be?","nextNodeIds":[736920104]},{"nodeId":736920104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":2550350434,"text":"Our Darshan has set up a little game called \"Mimetic Replication.\"","nextNodeIds":[736920105]},{"nodeId":736920105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":3605060266,"text":"In this game, I will introduce you to the behavioral patterns of certain animals.","nextNodeIds":[736920106]},{"nodeId":736920106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":1596028338,"text":"Of course, these patterns have been simplified and generalized to make them easier to understand.","nextNodeIds":[736920107]},{"nodeId":736920107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":2048892146,"text":"What you'll need to do is to use the models we have prepared to imitate the actions of the corresponding animals.","nextNodeIds":[736920108,736920109]},{"nodeId":736920108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":567354618,"text":"That does sound pretty simple.","nextNodeIds":[736920110]},{"nodeId":736920110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":2676824114,"text":"Precisely. \"Animals have regular behavioral patterns\" is a statement that is both simple to understand and accept.","nextNodeIds":[736920111]},{"nodeId":736920111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":3554051218,"text":"But behind something so simple lie mysteries that are most deep indeed.","nextNodeIds":[736920112]},{"nodeId":736920112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":2753467818,"text":"However, let us put academic observation aside for the moment and simply enjoy the habitual behaviors of animals in a relaxed manner.","nextNodeIds":[736920113,736920115]},{"nodeId":736920113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2252078130,"text":"I'll give this one a go, why not?","nextNodeIds":[736920114]},{"nodeId":736920114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":908763146,"text":"Alright. In that case, please step over here.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":736920115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":392137218,"text":"I've got other things to do at the moment.","nextNodeIds":[736920116]},{"nodeId":736920116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30350,"speakerName":"Paz","textMapHash":1336847282,"text":"That's fine. My booth will be open throughout the Gala, so you can come over and try the game out any time.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":736920109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1248594010,"text":"Can't say that sounds difficult.","nextNodeIds":[736920110]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7369201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUI